 "summary": "The markup language of MediaWiki and Wikipedia: apostrophe-based emphasis, [[internal links]], sections, lists and tables, plus a macro layer of templates with parameters, magic words and parser functions that is effectively a small (Turing-complete with recursion limits) template language.",
